8.3 AI Assistance and Team Contribution
We used ChatGPT to help organize the report, explain feasibility concepts, draft and revise text, and suggest sources, cost assumptions, calculations, and project risks. The team divided the sections among its members and adapted the material for the report. AI-generated estimates are identified as assumptions rather than actual university data or measured results. Interviews and stakeholder feedback must come from the team’s own work. The team remains responsible for checking the sources and calculations, assessing whether the assumptions are realistic, editing the final content, and making the project decisions.
